1
00:00:01,483 --> 00:00:04,992
The Black Ambulance

2
00:00:06,939 --> 00:00:08,900
The black ambulance?

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:11,698
That's right. An ambulance blackened by soot.

4
00:00:11,698 --> 00:00:16,774
The children taken away as its prey will have their souls stolen by the Grim Reaper,

5
00:00:16,774 --> 00:00:18,975
never to be seen again.

6
00:00:18,975 --> 00:00:21,390
Aah!! I'm so scared!

7
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:23,742
Is that what you wanted to hear? Then you'll need to try a better story!

8
00:00:23,742 --> 00:00:26,335
Y-yeah, we know it's just a myth!

9
00:00:26,335 --> 00:00:28,155
I've heard about it too.

10
00:00:28,155 --> 00:00:33,713
A child was kidnapped by the black ambulance, and by the time he was found...

11
00:00:33,713 --> 00:00:36,131
he had been turned into a mummy!

12
00:00:36,131 --> 00:00:37,932
Aaah!

13
00:00:37,932 --> 00:00:39,743
Stop it already, Anna!

14
00:00:39,743 --> 00:00:42,487
Yeah! Come on, guys! Knock it off already!

15
00:00:42,487 --> 00:00:43,987
It's not even a good story!

16
00:00:43,987 --> 00:00:45,439
You were the one who asked!

17
00:00:45,439 --> 00:00:47,935
I was just getting to the good part and you ruined it!

18
00:00:47,935 --> 00:00:49,359
Yeah, right.

19
00:00:49,359 --> 00:00:51,987
You guys need to grow up and stop telling those silly stories.

20
00:00:51,987 --> 00:00:52,881
Jun...!

21
00:00:53,179 --> 00:00:55,258
Come on. What's his deal?

22
00:00:57,387 --> 00:01:02,978
He used to love stories about robots and ghosts... I wonder what's the matter?

23
00:01:04,513 --> 00:01:05,319
Huh?

24
00:01:07,537 --> 00:01:08,638
...a tire?

25
00:01:09,230 --> 00:01:11,733
Waaugh!

26
00:01:11,733 --> 00:01:13,435
W-Where did it come from??

27
00:01:27,492 --> 00:01:28,460
Hm?

28
00:01:30,158 --> 00:01:31,698
T-Theo?

29
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:37,956
Was that the...?!

30
00:01:38,753 --> 00:01:39,703
I'm back!

31
00:01:39,703 --> 00:01:41,049
Hey Jun, what's up?

32
00:01:44,340 --> 00:01:45,658
What's going on?

33
00:01:45,658 --> 00:01:47,281
I'm giving them a health checkup.

34
00:01:49,622 --> 00:01:51,390
Sorry to say... but I'm faster.

35
00:01:56,158 --> 00:01:57,746
I don't think so!

36
00:02:03,132 --> 00:02:05,370
That's enough, you can stop! Stop!

37
00:02:07,587 --> 00:02:09,360
Blue Cop is in tip-top shape.

38
00:02:10,026 --> 00:02:11,521
I do feel better than ever.

39
00:02:11,521 --> 00:02:14,669
Mega Trucker, you have a worn out damper in your knee.

40
00:02:14,669 --> 00:02:16,073
Wait, what?

41
00:02:16,073 --> 00:02:17,752
How can you tell?

42
00:02:17,752 --> 00:02:22,026
Because, after ten years in this job, I can tell a lot just by the sound of things.

43
00:02:22,026 --> 00:02:24,872
Whaddya mean? I need fixing? No way!

44
00:02:24,872 --> 00:02:28,704
Uncle Edo's the best mechanic around. You can count on him, even if he is a bit of a grump.

45
00:02:28,704 --> 00:02:30,443
Hey, I heard that...

46
00:02:30,943 --> 00:02:32,848
Jun! Uncle Edo!

47
00:02:33,031 --> 00:02:34,006
Quick, transform!

48
00:02:36,353 --> 00:02:40,788
Aah, what a surprise, Anna! What brings you here?

49
00:02:40,788 --> 00:02:44,252
It's an emergency! Theo has been kidnapped by the black ambulance!

50
00:02:44,252 --> 00:02:45,061
What?!

51
00:02:49,721 --> 00:02:51,145
You're the new kid, right?

52
00:02:53,151 --> 00:02:54,872
Your name was... T...

53
00:02:54,872 --> 00:02:55,735
Theo!

54
00:02:55,735 --> 00:02:57,800
Oh, that's it! Theo!

55
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:00,497
My name's Jun. Come play with us!

56
00:03:00,497 --> 00:03:03,169
No, I couldn't... I'm not good at sports...

57
00:03:03,169 --> 00:03:07,567
Don't worry! No one starts out being good at something!

58
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:13,455
Are you awake now?

59
00:03:13,455 --> 00:03:14,704
Sorry about that.

60
00:03:14,704 --> 00:03:16,483
My tire slipped off earlier.

61
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:19,247
A-are you a talking ambulance?

62
00:03:19,549 --> 00:03:21,586
Oh, pardon me. My apologies.

63
00:03:24,704 --> 00:03:26,400
My name is Mega Ambler.

64
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:29,650
I'm a Metal Cardbot that looked after patients on planet Machina.

65
00:03:29,650 --> 00:03:32,009
Ma-chi-na Me-tal Card-bot...?

66
00:03:32,009 --> 00:03:33,002
Huh?

67
00:03:33,292 --> 00:03:35,563
I saw it with my own two eyes!

68
00:03:35,563 --> 00:03:37,658
The police car turned into a robot!

69
00:03:37,658 --> 00:03:39,127
Could this be...

70
00:03:39,663 --> 00:03:41,411
The black ambulance?

71
00:03:41,411 --> 00:03:43,388
Just sounds like some urban legend to me.

72
00:03:43,388 --> 00:03:45,461
I saw it with my very own eyes!

73
00:03:45,461 --> 00:03:46,533
Hey, it's Theo...

74
00:03:46,663 --> 00:03:47,860
Huh?!

75
00:03:47,860 --> 00:03:49,358
A Metal Cardbot?!

76
00:03:49,581 --> 00:03:51,764
What is it? Let me see!

77
00:03:51,764 --> 00:03:53,548
Hey, hey! This is private!

78
00:03:53,548 --> 00:03:55,711
You should respect his privacy, Anna!

79
00:03:55,711 --> 00:03:58,626
Don't worry, you can leave the Theo case to me.

80
00:03:58,626 --> 00:04:02,337
Uh, why don't you tell me more about that ambulance over here...

81
00:04:04,149 --> 00:04:05,322
Blue Cop!

82
00:04:09,627 --> 00:04:13,048
I knew I could count on Theo. He even sent a map!

83
00:04:13,247 --> 00:04:15,217
So that means... they're a friend of yours?

84
00:04:16,218 --> 00:04:17,725
Hang in there, Theo...

85
00:04:25,596 --> 00:04:26,862
Jun...

86
00:04:27,661 --> 00:04:29,262
Now, let me have a look at you.

87
00:04:29,262 --> 00:04:30,747
Look... at me...?

88
00:04:30,747 --> 00:04:32,129
Lie down and stay still.

89
00:04:36,447 --> 00:04:38,901
Hm. No broken bones.

90
00:04:38,901 --> 00:04:39,439
Alright, then.

91
00:04:42,201 --> 00:04:43,189
Examination complete.

92
00:04:44,288 --> 00:04:46,247
Wrapping things up...

93
00:04:46,696 --> 00:04:48,386
What is going on?

94
00:04:48,386 --> 00:04:50,591
Help me, Jun!

95
00:04:51,192 --> 00:04:52,658
I told you to stay still!

96
00:04:56,191 --> 00:04:57,634
Theo! Are you okay?!

97
00:04:57,634 --> 00:04:59,538
Jun! Get me out of here!

98
00:04:59,538 --> 00:05:00,627
What's this?

99
00:05:00,627 --> 00:05:03,033
Mega Ambler! Step away from the child!

100
00:05:03,033 --> 00:05:04,685
Did the police car just t-talk?

101
00:05:04,685 --> 00:05:06,843
Are you also a Metal Cardbot?

102
00:05:07,833 --> 00:05:08,511
What should we do?

103
00:05:08,511 --> 00:05:10,314
Don't worry about Theo!

104
00:05:10,314 --> 00:05:11,420
Alright.

105
00:05:13,629 --> 00:05:16,146
There are more robots?

106
00:05:16,146 --> 00:05:17,408
Who are you, then?

107
00:05:17,408 --> 00:05:19,324
You don't know each other?

108
00:05:19,324 --> 00:05:21,826
Mega Ambler is a notorious travelling doctor.

109
00:05:21,826 --> 00:05:24,250
He goes around treating people without a license,

110
00:05:24,250 --> 00:05:26,697
and charging them exorbitant fees.

111
00:05:26,697 --> 00:05:28,983
But you can't deny my skills are the real deal!

112
00:05:31,024 --> 00:05:32,088
Blue Cop!

113
00:05:33,153 --> 00:05:34,932
Looks like you need my help again.

114
00:05:34,932 --> 00:05:36,045
Mega Trucker?

115
00:05:36,045 --> 00:05:37,970
There's no time to waste. Just say the word!

116
00:05:44,723 --> 00:05:46,396
Metal Breath, pickup!

117
00:05:48,257 --> 00:05:49,886
Mega Trucker, setup!

118
00:06:09,172 --> 00:06:10,459
Just sit back and watch!

119
00:06:11,060 --> 00:06:12,403
A-another one?

120
00:06:12,403 --> 00:06:13,526
Theo, you gotta run!

121
00:06:14,228 --> 00:06:15,826
Oh, o-okay!

122
00:06:16,627 --> 00:06:17,963
Another patient?

123
00:06:17,963 --> 00:06:20,798
Mega Trucker, Mega Power Tackle!

124
00:06:21,038 --> 00:06:23,723
Mega Power Tackle!

125
00:06:26,095 --> 00:06:28,875
Haha, that's not gonna work on me!

126
00:06:30,439 --> 00:06:33,509
How'd ya like that? Mega Trucker power!

127
00:06:33,509 --> 00:06:35,699
That was definitely powerful...

128
00:06:37,129 --> 00:06:38,534
...however,

129
00:06:40,516 --> 00:06:41,716
I found your weak spot!

130
00:06:41,716 --> 00:06:43,468
Mega Trucker, watch out!

131
00:06:43,468 --> 00:06:44,127
Huh?

132
00:06:50,870 --> 00:06:52,476
What's going on here...?

133
00:06:52,976 --> 00:06:54,488
You've been slacking on your maintenance.

134
00:06:54,488 --> 00:06:56,687
You should have listened to Edo...

135
00:07:01,677 --> 00:07:02,536
Are you alright?

136
00:07:02,536 --> 00:07:04,766
Yes. And I'm ready to fight!

137
00:07:04,766 --> 00:07:07,581
Got it. Mega Trucker, take back!

138
00:07:07,581 --> 00:07:08,814
H-hold on!

139
00:07:10,303 --> 00:07:11,288
Don't push yourself.

140
00:07:15,228 --> 00:07:16,976
Blue Cop, setup!

141
00:07:38,045 --> 00:07:39,293
Hm?

142
00:07:39,293 --> 00:07:41,178
Broke out of your bandages, I see.

143
00:07:41,978 --> 00:07:44,377
It's no use trying to find a weak spot.

144
00:07:44,377 --> 00:07:46,961
I take thorough care of myself, unlike a certain someone.

145
00:07:46,961 --> 00:07:48,266
I heard that!

146
00:07:48,711 --> 00:07:50,084
Maybe so...

147
00:07:50,084 --> 00:07:52,653
But, a weak spot can easily be made!

148
00:07:53,125 --> 00:07:55,151
That's not what a doctor does!

149
00:07:55,151 --> 00:07:56,598
Blue Cop, Burst Shot!

150
00:07:57,098 --> 00:07:58,625
Burst... Shot!

151
00:08:02,314 --> 00:08:03,629
Forceps Shock!

152
00:08:09,033 --> 00:08:11,564
What's wrong? Should I have a look?

153
00:08:13,213 --> 00:08:14,576
That didn't even leave a scratch.

154
00:08:18,499 --> 00:08:19,488
Huh...?

155
00:08:21,668 --> 00:08:22,673
That's not good.

156
00:08:22,673 --> 00:08:24,981
Aah! What's wrong with your arm?!

157
00:08:24,981 --> 00:08:27,298
I'll take care of your other arm too!

158
00:08:27,298 --> 00:08:28,434
Blue Cop, watch out!

159
00:08:35,244 --> 00:08:37,100
Blue Cop, can you move your shoulder?

160
00:08:39,105 --> 00:08:41,313
Yes, I think it's okay.

161
00:08:41,313 --> 00:08:44,265
Alright! I have an idea.

162
00:08:46,365 --> 00:08:47,775
I let my guard down...

163
00:08:52,139 --> 00:08:53,322
What are you doing?

164
00:08:53,644 --> 00:08:54,701
So I just do this?

165
00:08:54,701 --> 00:08:55,945
Trust me!

166
00:08:57,162 --> 00:08:59,076
I'll make it so you can't move at all!

167
00:09:02,476 --> 00:09:05,673
Now! Megabolt Punch!

168
00:09:06,110 --> 00:09:08,748
Mega...bolt...

169
00:09:08,748 --> 00:09:10,619
Punch!!

170
00:09:18,028 --> 00:09:19,023
That's it!

171
00:09:20,533 --> 00:09:23,586
Metal Cardbot... Change Up!

172
00:09:42,336 --> 00:09:45,120
Mega Ambler... sealed!

173
00:09:52,446 --> 00:09:53,849
Is your arm alright?

174
00:09:54,149 --> 00:09:56,213
I think I'll need a little help from Edo.

175
00:09:57,591 --> 00:09:58,459
Oh!

176
00:09:58,459 --> 00:10:00,019
Theo! Are you okay?

177
00:10:02,166 --> 00:10:05,816
Blue Cop... I can tell Theo, right? He's my best friend.

178
00:10:05,816 --> 00:10:06,765
Jun!

179
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,969
Of course. If he's your friend.

180
00:10:11,888 --> 00:10:14,499
Theo! There's something you need to know.

181
00:10:20,088 --> 00:10:21,033
How's that?

182
00:10:21,333 --> 00:10:23,353
That's much better!

183
00:10:23,696 --> 00:10:24,713
And Blue Cop?

184
00:10:25,514 --> 00:10:26,901
As good as new.

185
00:10:26,901 --> 00:10:29,903
We have this one all cleaned up now, too.

186
00:10:30,649 --> 00:10:32,709
I think you're all set now!

187
00:10:37,946 --> 00:10:40,168
Theo. I have a favor to ask.

188
00:10:40,168 --> 00:10:45,002
Don't worry! I promise I won't tell anyone about the Metal Cardbots.

189
00:10:45,803 --> 00:10:48,110
I'm sorry I startled you earlier.

190
00:10:48,110 --> 00:10:50,163
Let's be friends from now on.

191
00:10:50,163 --> 00:10:52,927
I'd be happy to call you my friend, Mega Ambler!

192
00:10:53,846 --> 00:10:55,297
Ah! That hurt!

193
00:10:55,297 --> 00:10:56,923
Oops! I'm sorry!

